Spectrum
--------
ChebyCast is inspired by the method described in:

    Adaptive Spectral Feature Forecasting for Diffusion Sampling Acceleration
    Jiaqi Han, Juntong Shi, Puheng Li, Haotian Ye, Qiushan Guo, Stefano Ermon
    CVPR 2026 / arXiv:2603.01623
    https://github.com/hanjq17/Spectrum

The official Spectrum implementation is distributed under the MIT License:

    MIT License
    Copyright (c) 2026 Jiaqi Han

ChebyCast is not an official Spectrum port and is not intended to reproduce
the official implementation faithfully. It independently adapts the spectral
forecasting idea to Forge-derived Stable Diffusion WebUIs and changes execution
semantics for solver-step-aware and fixed-step multi-stage sampling.

